WEBVTT

00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:40.100
As ordered by His Majesty, Sion Astal,

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:43.520
Ryner Lute, I shall dispose of you.

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:51.540
There is a favor I would ask of you.

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:58.090
Please follow His Majesty's orders and kill Ryner Lute.

00:02:01.940 --> 00:02:04.140
I respectfully decline.

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:11.940
Let there be darkness!

00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:20.530
Let there be-

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:26.410
These are...

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:39.650
Just try to lay one finger of that filthy hand on Milk Callaud!

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:40.970
I'll kill you on the spot!

00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:45.180
We show no forgiveness to those who meddle in our family.

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:49.050
If you understand, blink once and only once.

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:59.480
I understand. I shall release Milk Callaud.

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:03.750
I do not wish to die yet.

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:08.740
I'll keep your life in my hands until her well-being is ascertained.

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:12.930
You're quite cautious.

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:17.480
Is that a hero relic?

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:21.430
I picked up something that Ryner Lute forgot to recover.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:24.010
The threads from this needle extend infinitely,

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:27.170
and they are durable to the point that they cannot be cut.

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:29.420
But that is all they are.

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:33.670
Given that it can be this dangerous of a weapon in the right hands...

00:03:33.670 --> 00:03:38.610
...if a country other than Roland wound up obtaining such power...

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:41.480
Gastark, you mean?

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:45.590
Yes. You've been watching, haven't you?

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:49.930
Having observed his journey, what did you think of him?

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:52.180
Do you think that Ryner Lute's existence is truly needed?

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:57.470
For Roland, or for His Majesty, Sion Astal?

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:02.300
A peaceful world where no one dies and no one cries.

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:05.990
It's a wonderful, truly lovely ideal.

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:08.360
However, it is...

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:09.760
...an illusion.

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:20.190
You've been hiding your real power all this time, haven't you?!

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:23.950
You've parted from His Majesty's side and ignored all pleas to return!

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:25.620
You've fled the kingdom!

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:27.910
So you're carrying out your orders and killing me?!

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:32.740
You're a very kind man.

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:37.190
I can understand how Captain Milk came to care for you.

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:40.480
If you were to die, the Captain would grieve, I'm certain.

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:44.710
But... This is something I do of my own will.

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:48.130
You do not belong at His Majesty's side!

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:51.110
Lafra. Lafra.

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:55.800
Tiir?

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:57.270
Something's wrong.

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:07.270
The outcome is practically already decided.

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:09.100
However...

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:12.770
Struggle all you might, you cannot win against me!

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:16.630
Traps on both sides.

00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:18.330
None in the center, huh?

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:24.020
You saw through them?

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:26.010
You talk too much, you know!

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:29.500
Gotcha.

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:37.800
What the hell?

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:43.100
Checkmate.

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:49.800
<i>Why not just let him?</i>

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.890
<i>If I kept living any longer than this,</i>

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:55.870
<i>Someone like me would just be...</i>

00:06:05.940 --> 00:06:07.130
Ferris?!

00:06:08.690 --> 00:06:10.680
Hm? I didn't see you there.

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:12.880
I'm going to kill you!

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:15.820
Hm? I didn't see you there.

00:06:15.820 --> 00:06:17.220
What the hell is your problem?

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:18.990
Hm? I didn't see you there.

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:20.810
Sorry, I guess you must be mad at me!

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:23.640
I'll apologize, so just wait a second.

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:25.900
I'll treat you to dumplings or something...

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:30.750
More importantly, why is that man trying to kill you?

00:06:31.310 --> 00:06:33.030
Did you tail me here?

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:36.330
You were aware of me?

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:47.180
Brother Tiir!

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:50.180
R-Run.

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:52.630
This one... I'll...

00:06:57.230 --> 00:07:02.350
Go on, eat those around you like you always do and heal your wounds.

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:05.540
You could kill me for certain this time.

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:11.230
Hey!

00:07:11.230 --> 00:07:12.650
R-Ryner.

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:14.190
Lafra!

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:15.630
Gastark has...

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:22.660
Pueka!

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:33.590
Lafra!

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:38.930
Ryner... Please... Your promise...

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:04.110
An Alpha Stigma?

00:08:04.110 --> 00:08:06.050
No... Not on my watch!

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:12.080
Ryner!

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:13.410
Don't get in my way.

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:16.260
You lowly monster.

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:31.190
Gouge out the crystals, Spunquel!

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:42.320
Two to start with.

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:56.560
All the rest of you, get on with it. Go out of control and turn into crystal.

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:57.850
You bunch of monsters.

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:07.080
<i>For the sad bearers of the Eyes of God, who have lost faith in humans.</i>

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:08.520
<i>I want you to save them.</i>

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:15.400
You're so kind, so weak, so lonely, it makes me sad.

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:19.530
Gastark!

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:25.830
Whoa, there! You're pretty damn quick!

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:29.940
Lightning Beasts!

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:42.270
Ryner!

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:43.770
Try all you like, it won't do you any good!

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:45.930
Damn you!

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:52.650
You're in my way, lino Doue!

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:56.070
What I seek is the burning field! Kurenai!

00:09:57.980 --> 00:09:59.420
Whoa, there!

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:02.470
Lightning Beasts!

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:12.880
Oh, damn it all!

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:17.300
I killed that one before they crystallized! Geez.

00:10:20.490 --> 00:10:21.140
Ryner?

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:24.630
I'll kill you.

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:27.810
Ryner! You can't! Get back!

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:35.440
Lightning Beasts!

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:38.200
What I seek is thunder! Izu...

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:02.230
Are you a fool?! Running right into the middle of magic...

00:11:02.230 --> 00:11:03.810
You're the fool!

00:11:03.810 --> 00:11:05.190
If...

00:11:05.190 --> 00:11:07.020
If you want to die alone that badly...

00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:10.140
...just die.

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:16.660
If you're going to be a monster and not my friend,

00:11:16.660 --> 00:11:18.430
then just go off and disappear!

00:11:19.270 --> 00:11:21.250
If you won't consider yourself my ally,

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:23.530
my manservant, or my tea-drinking companion...

00:11:23.830 --> 00:11:26.360
...just do what you want.

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:29.920
But I won't think of you that way.

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:34.730
No matter how much you see yourself as a monster...

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:39.580
No matter how much you deny how lonely you are when you're by yourself...

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:41.470
I won't think of you that way.

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:47.460
My! That was a magnificent delivery!

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:49.760
If this was a fairy tale,

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:51.980
the monster would turn into a human in the end,

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:54.690
and everyone would live happily ever after.

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:59.050
I hate to disappoint you, but the fact that he's a monster will never change.

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:00.150
So what?

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:05.160
It doesn't matter to me what he is, monster or not.

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:07.700
You say such amusing things.

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:11.390
But he's just a monster who harms the world just by being alive.

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:14.580
It might not matter to you, but it sure as hell matters to the rest of the world.

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:17.040
Dangerous monsters cannot be allowed to live.

00:12:17.390 --> 00:12:19.120
You think I care?

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:24.160
You say you don't care?

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:28.500
You say it so... so offhandedly...

00:12:29.650 --> 00:12:32.310
I-I...

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:35.770
I...

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:39.030
Is it okay for me to live?

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:42.730
Fool.

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:46.910
If you died... you know I'd be lonely.

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:54.810
Then I guess you'll be lonely real soon.

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:57.670
After all, he's going to die right here!

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:02.800
Ferris!

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:05.060
Resonate!

00:13:11.650 --> 00:13:13.350
It's come...

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:15.400
Ryner?!

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:21.440
Just like back then...

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:25.240
It doesn't matter.

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:26.630
Stop it.

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:28.370
Nothing matters.

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:31.370
You're wrong! Stop!

00:13:32.350 --> 00:13:37.580
You desire it... The destruction of everything. Annihilation.

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:39.400
You're wrong!

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:48.190
Life... Death... Joy... Sorrow... None of it matters.

00:13:48.190 --> 00:13:50.140
You're wrong. Shut up!

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:53.960
Don't fight it. You desire it.

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:57.350
No matter how much the world fills you with despair...

00:13:57.780 --> 00:13:59.860
To you, none of it matters.

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:01.680
Shut up!

00:14:01.680 --> 00:14:03.310
Come, let us bring it to an end.

00:14:03.310 --> 00:14:09.330
Everything... is yours to toy with. Release it. Open up. Kill... everything.

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:12.200
Until everything disappears from before your eyes...

00:14:12.510 --> 00:14:15.430
Until everything disappears from before your eyes!

00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:18.210
Shut up!

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:25.410
<i>I'm a monster. A monster who does nothing but hurt people.</i>

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:30.890
<i>These blood-stained hands can't reach anywhere.</i>

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:32.910
<i>I know that.</i>

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:44.720
<i>But I still want to save them! I want to reach them! To extend my hand!</i>

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:48.420
<i>If there's anything left that I can do!</i>

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:02.540
You son of a bitch!

00:15:08.890 --> 00:15:11.550
You stopped the crystallization?!

00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:14.520
W-What are you?!

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:16.930
A monster!

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:18.520
No, you don't!

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:23.860
The Latsel Thread?!

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:27.550
Oh? Is that its name?

00:15:27.550 --> 00:15:30.550
I'll deliver your head to Gastark.

00:15:30.550 --> 00:15:33.560
They'll learn just what it means

00:15:33.560 --> 00:15:36.060
to pick a fight with Roland.

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:37.700
Spunquel!

00:15:38.590 --> 00:15:41.350
What I seek is thunder! Izuchi!

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:50.540
Tiir!

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:58.360
I'll hold him off. Take the kids!

00:15:58.360 --> 00:15:59.980
Thanks.

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:06.720
Gastark. Next time, you're dead!

00:16:09.560 --> 00:16:11.660
I'll be sure to come for you.

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:14.540
You don't belong there.

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:18.160
What's the big idea? Hold it!

00:16:24.340 --> 00:16:27.970
Not gonna happen. I'm your opponent here!

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:34.220
Oh, for crying out loud. My whole harvest is one crystal?!

00:16:35.770 --> 00:16:37.760
Solver of all formulas.

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:40.950
Who would have thought you'd still show up in Roland?

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:43.210
All formulas?

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:46.790
Wait, you mean you don't know?

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:48.580
You don't know about yourself?

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:51.360
Oh, that's just rich!

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:54.990
Guess that means the hero isn't complete yet.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:04.010
It would seem that our situation has changed considerably.

00:17:04.010 --> 00:17:05.280
Hey!

00:17:05.280 --> 00:17:07.880
Ferris should wake up any moment now.

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:12.270
All she has is a light concussion. No need to worry.

00:17:12.270 --> 00:17:16.750
If you are truly no ordinary monster...

00:17:22.860 --> 00:17:24.060
Are you all right?

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:25.660
Yeah.

00:17:28.910 --> 00:17:29.980
No problem.

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:43.270
Sion...

00:17:43.900 --> 00:17:48.830
After you left, do you have any idea what kind of expression he had?

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:54.880
Do you think he truly wishes to kill you?

00:17:55.970 --> 00:18:00.390
He takes everything upon himself... He works really hard.

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:05.350
Our king isn't like your king.

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:07.350
A country where everyone can live happily...

00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:11.730
He's a genuine fool who seriously aims for that goal.

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:18.850
And here I went through all that dramatic posturing... I'm hopeless, huh?

00:18:18.850 --> 00:18:23.580
Indeed. This is hardly the first time you've acted that way.

00:18:23.860 --> 00:18:28.250
Yeah. But you guys are something else.

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:33.460
Going to all this trouble to chase down a hopeless guy like me...

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:36.460
Because I was afraid of hurting others...

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:40.760
Because I was afraid of being hurt, I ran away and ended up alone.

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:47.600
But I could never truly be alone.

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:52.480
No matter how much I saw despair, the sadder I grew, the more my mind...

00:18:57.730 --> 00:19:02.320
I'll go back to Roland. No more running away.

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:05.000
I might end up using my power.

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.580
Gastark's getting to look dangerous.

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:09.220
I see.

00:19:09.220 --> 00:19:13.580
But before that, I'd like to ask one favor of you.

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:16.590
If I go out of control again,

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:19.660
I'd like to be killed by you.

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:25.940
All this time, I've fled from the truth of being a monster.

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:31.550
To be honest, I was scared. That one day I could kill you.

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:36.380
So... I want to give you courage.

00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:38.940
Courage?

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:42.040
The courage to fight to the end without running.

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:47.310
Then, if you return...

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:49.850
Thanks.

00:19:57.130 --> 00:20:00.880
<i>Ryner Lute is returning to Roland of his own volition.</i>

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:04.880
<i>In addition, a number of Magic Eye bearers from all across the continent</i>

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:07.820
<i>have gathered to form an anti-Gastark force,</i>

00:20:07.820 --> 00:20:10.310
<i>and with Ryner Lute acting as a go-between,</i>

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:15.650
<i>we may now consider the possibility of forming an anti-Gastark war front.</i>

00:20:17.310 --> 00:20:21.020
Such things hold no meaning.

00:20:21.590 --> 00:20:25.780
How useful Ryner could be, or useless...

00:20:26.180 --> 00:20:27.740
Such things are...

00:20:29.190 --> 00:20:34.310
The truth is, if Luke Stokkart had killed Ryner Lute for you,

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:38.070
that might have been better for you.

00:20:38.810 --> 00:20:41.880
Isn't that why you issued that decree?

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:44.300
I...

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:46.910
I won't kill Ryner.

00:20:47.570 --> 00:20:49.810
You won't kill Ryner Lute?

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:51.310
That's right.

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:57.480
That means you choose an even crueler path.

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:02.190
I thought that since Ryner was such a dear friend to you,

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:06.220
it would have been better to kill him sooner.

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:09.670
But are you truly sure about this?

00:21:09.670 --> 00:21:13.370
If you kill that one, a replacement will be born immediately.

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:17.430
Just like you. If you're both gears of the world,

00:21:17.430 --> 00:21:20.410
there's no need to make sacrifices out of friends.

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:24.900
You will advance only down the right path.

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:30.470
The strength to crush all that you hold dear underfoot if the need arises...

00:21:31.530 --> 00:21:37.790
Friends, loved ones, everything. That is your unique nature.

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:43.130
I pray you don't regret this.

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:45.370
My...

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:48.550
My hero...

00:23:20.760 --> 00:23:23.000
<i>Enough with the crap.</i>

00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:27.220
<i>I know I said that, but come on! Everything has a limit!</i>

00:23:27.220 --> 00:23:30.210
<i>What's with this mountain of work?! Curse you, Sion, are you an ogre?!</i>

00:23:30.210 --> 00:23:34.080
<i>Damn it! I knew I shouldn't have come back!</i>
